        "id": 1974835310,
        "content": "As a rule of thumb, if it uses our latest SDK or logger, it should be using ESM because these packages do.\r\nIn practice, this changes two things during the build: `require` gets converted to `import`, `__dirname` becomes `import.meta.dirname`, and a package.json is generated within the dist to make the node runner treat this as ESM during a run by specifying `type: module`.",
